<title>MALTA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>MALTA GOVERNMENT LIST (970326)</p>
<p>  President...............Dr Ugo MIFSUD BONNICI</p>
<p>(Elected 4 April 94 for 5-year term)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>LABOUR PARTY GOVERNMENT (Sworn in 29 Oct 1996):</p>
<p>Prime Minister.....Alfred SANT</p>
<p>(Sworn in 28 Oct 96)</p>
<p>  Deputy Prime Minister............George VELLA</p>
<p>(Also Foreign Minister)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p>  Agriculture, Fisheries..........Noel FARRUGIA</p>
